  "scope": [
    "Shared owner-scoped Catalog product/GTIN reader for all production screens and automatic WB/Ozon pipeline",
    "Own Catalog key discovery on fresh Windows device and authenticated recovery after foreign DPAPI ciphertext",
    "Catalog listing across product groups, normalized GTINs, batched card reads and explicit per-card reports",
    "Published products no longer hidden for missing permit metadata",
    "Dedicated registry and UI Catalog workers, cancellable deadlines and bounded readback retries",
    "Indexed exact GTIN/article/color/size matching and exact Ozon product/offer/SKU guards",
    "GTIN-only sync no longer depends on prices or metadata dictionaries",
    "Seller-imported KIZ category allocation without Znack checks or matching product GTINs; paid purchases remain verified",
    "Explicit card creation/moderation/signing and independent exact publication readback",
    "Reviewed WB/Ozon GTIN actions; source reads do not approve writes; Ozon name and SKU guards",
    "Bounded read-only moderation monitor in the existing Znack sync worker",
    "National Catalog product-list date interval fixed after live reproduction: 0 records before, 1961 after",
    "Reviewed WB shipment KIZ sources saved per shipment; seller imports by synced native category without Znack or matching product GTIN",
    "Paid source excludes imported codes and uses existing purchase/introduction pipeline for only the deficit",
    "Virtualized WB shipment paid GTIN inventory; 2000 synthetic rows remain scrollable without constructing all cards",
    "Shared read-authenticated Catalog and ELK sessions for GS1 UI and background worker, with independent expiry/recovery and per-account locking",
    "Shop/certificate-scoped membership and balance cache, independent success timestamps, explicit partial/whole failure persistence",
    "Reported and coalesced GS1 synchronization with per-source phases, bounded waits and observer lifecycle",
    "Compact membership/six checks/prefix/inbox UI with Znack configuration and read-only source report actions",
    "Catalog profile email reused as a mailbox configuration hint; reviewed API forms and seller-configured SMTP/IMAP retained",
    "Compact copy wizard with optional detail sections and actionable per-field preview errors",
    "Source values remain inherited; separate explicit edits and per-variant prices persist in backwards-compatible drafts",
    "Real prepared destination data, dictionary labels and variant prices displayed before publication",
    "Primary image and full source barcode coverage checked; unsupported source fields reported explicitly",
    "Bounded selected-job reconciliation, durable no-duplicate writes and native WB size-price readback",
    "Ozon FBS shares shipment KIZ source UI, native category/type stock and frozen source selection from readiness to local print allocation",
    "Ozon primary image handles string/array/object, excludes ambiguous SKU and checks posting offer identity",
    "Durable per-posting FBS print report separates local KIZ, PDF and remote acceptance",
    "Shared compact styling for all workspace FXML and Java pages, responsive header overflow and manually collapsible navigation",
    "Keyed FBS and product row updates preserve unchanged rows, selections and scroll position, including mutable WB values and changed Ozon product enrichment",
    "Owner-scoped image callbacks survive unchanged FBS refreshes, with bounded two-pulse GS1 conversation scrolling",
    "Dialogs respect owner size, task states and print phases are localized, report timestamps use Moscow time"
  ],
